{title: Ka Karoon Sajani Aaye Na Baalam}
{artist: Yesudas Rajesh Roshan}
{key: Gm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Gm] Ka karoo [Cm] sajani,        [F] aye Na [Gm] balam
[Gm] Khoja ra [Cm] hi hai piya,        [F] paradesi akhiya
aye na [Gm] balam ...        [G] Jab bhi koyi [Cm] aahat hove
[Cm] manva mora [Gm] bhage,        [G] Dekho kahi [Cm] tute nahi
[Cm] premake ye [Gm] dhage,        [G] Hai matavari prita [C] hamari
[F] Chupena [Gm] chupaye,        [Cm] Chupena [Gm] chupaye...
[Gm] Sawan [Cm] ho tum mai hu [F] tori,        [Gm] badariya, aye na [Gm] balam
[Gm] Bhor bhai aur [Cm] sanjh dhali re,        [F] samay ne li [Gm] angadayi ...
[Gm] Ye jaga sara [Cm] nind se hara,        [F] mohe nind na [Gm] aayi .
[G] O mai ghabarau, [C] dar dar jau,        [F] ayi vo na [Gm] aye,
[Cm] ayi vo na [Gm] aye...        [Gm] radha bul [Cm] aye kaha
[F] khoye ho kanhaiya,        aye na [Gm] balam
